2 Installation
**************

QuickSky ships with native packages for most platforms.

2.1 npm Package (Cross-Platform)
=================================

For Node.js (v14+) users, install globally:

     npm install -g quicksky-cli

2.2 DEB Package (Debian/Ubuntu)
================================

Download the latest '.deb' from releases and install:

     sudo dpkg -i quicksky_1.0.0_amd64.deb
     sudo apt-get install -f

2.3 macOS Packages
==================

* PKG Installer: Download '.pkg' and double-click to install
* DMG: Drag QuickSky binary to '/usr/local/bin'

2.4 Windows MSI
===============

Download '.msi' from releases and run the installer.

2.5 Verify Installation
========================

Check if working:

     sky --help


