3 Quick Start
*************

3.1 Initialize Repository
=========================

Run in your project directory:

     sky init

Follow prompts for username, remote URL, and main branch name.

3.2 Basic Workflow
==================

Upload changes:
     sky upload "Fix login bug"

Switch repositories:
     sky change-to my-other-project

Create new branch:
     sky branch -a feature/payment

View commit history:
     sky log


