5 Configuration
***************

5.1 Repository Configuration
============================

'.quicksky/config.toml'
     Repository configuration file containing user, remote, and branch
     settings

5.2 Commit Storage
==================

'.quicksky/commits/'
     Directory containing binary-serialized commit records

'.quicksky/branches.json'
     Branch state tracking file

'.quicksky/last_files.json'
     File hash cache for change detection

5.3 Global Registry
===================

'~/.quicksky_registry.json'
     Global repository registry for repo switching

5.4 Ignore Rules
================

'.skyhide'
     QuickSky-specific ignore rules (takes precedence over .gitignore)

'.gitignore'
     Standard ignore rules (supported for compatibility)


