7 Troubleshooting
*****************

7.1 Common Issues
=================

Repository not initialized:
     Run 'sky init' in your project directory

No changes detected:
     Ensure files are not ignored by '.skyhide' or '.gitignore'

Branch doesn't exist:
     Use 'sky branch' to list available branches

Repository not found:
     Repository may not be registered. Re-run 'sky init' or check
     '~/.quicksky_registry.json'

7.2 Getting Help
================

Command help:
     sky --help
     sky COMMAND --help

Report bugs:
     https://github.com/Saladin5101/QuickSky/issues

7.3 File Locations
==================

Check these files for debugging:
* '.quicksky/config.toml' - Repository config
* '~/.quicksky_registry.json' - Global registry
* '.quicksky/branches.json' - Branch state


